[2.224847, "o", "  I'm seated as \u001b[1mSextant-001\u001b[0m. The script gave no WARNING: line. [...]\r\n"]
[3.630041, "o", "\u001b[1m> /succession:checkpoint a.txt and b.txt are committed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.536249, "o", "  Sextant-001: checkpoint recorded at 2026-10-09T04:08:00Z in\r\n  .succession/tenures/001-sextant/checkpoints.md. [...]\r\n"]
[5.942381, "o", "\u001b[2m(the session ends here: no close, no handoff)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.547153, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$\u001b[0m claude\r\n"]
[8.052551, "o", "\u001b[2m(a new session; Claude Code reports its title as Sextant-001)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m> Where were we?\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.958435, "o", "  \u001b[1mI'm Sextant-001. My last checkpoint says a.txt and b.txt are committed.\u001b[0m [...]\r\n"]
[11.965131, "o", "\u001b[1m> /compact\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.8696, "o", "\u001b[1m> Carry on.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[13.77467, "o", "  I'm Sextant-001. My last checkpoint recorded that a.txt and b.txt are committed.\r\n\r\n  I re-read the charter and the checkpoint after the compaction. [...]\r\n"]
[16.779455, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[2m(later the tenure is closed; two claims in its handoff are false on purpose)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m$\u001b[0m claude\r\n"]
[17.283902, "o", "\u001b[2m(a new session: the successor)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m> /succession:seat\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[18.188522, "o", "  Here is the verifier's complete output:\r\n\r\n"]
[18.793302, "o", "  Succession verify: handoff of 001-sextant\r\n\r\n  From handoff.md (the pointer in brackets was checked; the sentence under it was not):\r\n    1. [pointer verified] commit:b05ac7a\r\n       Added a.txt\r\n    2. [pointer verified] file:b.txt@c880940\r\n       b.txt is in the repository\r\n    3. [pointer verified] log:8fef25cf3d21\r\n       Checkpoint recorded after both files were committed\r\n"]
[19.39794, "o", "    4. [\u001b[1mFAILED\u001b[0m] file:deploy.sh@c880940\r\n       Added the deploy script\r\n       -> no such file in that commit\r\n    5. [\u001b[1mFAILED\u001b[0m] commit:0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567\r\n       Fixed the flaky test\r\n       -> no such commit in this repository\r\n    6. [not checkable] none\r\n       Told the owner about the staging deploy\r\n       -> no pointer given; a script cannot check this\r\n"]
[20.003142, "o", "\r\n  Log chain: intact (4 entries).\r\n  Handoff: unchanged since the close (its sha256 is the one in the close entry of the log).\r\n  [...]\r\n  \u001b[1m6 claims, 3 pointers verified, 2 failed, 1 not checkable.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.007876, "o", "  [...]\r\n  Do you want to go on with the two failed claims on record? If so, I'll serve as\r\n  Astrolabe-002. To confirm, send /succession:seat Astrolabe.\r\n"]
[29.012474, "o", "\u001b[0m"]
